WEBVTT

00:00:05.503 --> 00:00:07.063
(SOFT MUSIC PLAYING
ON GRAMOPHONE)

00:00:12.943 --> 00:00:14.623
(FORKY GRUNTING)

00:00:14.983 --> 00:00:16.783
Ow! (WHINING)

00:00:17.063 --> 00:00:18.383
(ROPE CREAKING)

00:00:19.183 --> 00:00:20.463
FORKY: Hey, hey!

00:00:20.623 --> 00:00:22.783
-Benson, are we finished?
-FORKY: Ow!

00:00:22.863 --> 00:00:24.503
Oh, that feels great!

00:00:24.663 --> 00:00:26.263
Look at that! Good as new.

00:00:26.423 --> 00:00:28.863
Yeah. Thank you, uh, Benson.

00:00:28.943 --> 00:00:29.983
(CHUCKLES)

00:00:30.623 --> 00:00:32.943
Uh, so, um, when's Woody
coming back?

00:00:33.143 --> 00:00:34.783
Like I said, soon.

00:00:34.943 --> 00:00:36.183
He won't forget about you.

00:00:36.343 --> 00:00:37.343
How do you know?

00:00:37.503 --> 00:00:40.063
You have your child's name
written on your feet.

00:00:40.223 --> 00:00:41.223
(SCOFFS) Sticks.

00:00:41.383 --> 00:00:43.583
That makes you
a very important toy.

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.303
That's exactly
what Woody says.

00:00:45.903 --> 00:00:47.303
-Hmm. Interesting.
-(DOORBELL JINGLES)

00:00:47.383 --> 00:00:48.423
HARMONY: Hi, Grandma!
We're back!

00:00:48.623 --> 00:00:49.583
(GASPS) She's back.

00:00:51.103 --> 00:00:52.103
Who is she?

00:00:53.223 --> 00:00:54.223
GABBY GABBY: Harmony.

00:00:54.383 --> 00:00:55.383
FORKY: Wait a second...

00:00:55.583 --> 00:00:56.783
she took Woody.

00:00:56.943 --> 00:00:58.223
(GASPS) Did she lose him?

00:00:58.383 --> 00:01:01.343
No. My Harmony is perfect.

00:01:03.543 --> 00:01:04.863
(HARMONY HUMMING)

00:01:05.263 --> 00:01:07.423
Forky, it's tea time.
It's tea time.

00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:10.623
-Whoo-hoo! What is tea time?
-Oh, I'll show you.

00:01:12.783 --> 00:01:15.103
HARMONY: A little bit of milk,
two lumps of sugar.

00:01:22.103 --> 00:01:24.183
I've been practicing.
How do I look?

00:01:25.743 --> 00:01:26.903
Uh... A little higher.

00:01:27.743 --> 00:01:28.943
Stick out your pinky.

00:01:29.303 --> 00:01:30.303
Nice!

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:32.263
Mmm! Delicious!

00:01:32.423 --> 00:01:34.103
HARMONY'S MOM:
Harmony, sweetie, I'm leaving.

00:01:34.263 --> 00:01:35.503
Come give me a hug.

00:01:35.703 --> 00:01:37.623
Bye, Mom.
I love you.

00:01:44.783 --> 00:01:45.863
(GIGGLES)

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:52.943
When my voice box is fixed...

00:01:54.463 --> 00:01:56.903
I'll finally get my chance.

00:02:09.383 --> 00:02:11.823
Now, about our friend Woody.

00:02:11.983 --> 00:02:14.423
I wanna know
everything about him.

00:02:14.623 --> 00:02:15.703
Oh, yeah, Woody.

00:02:15.863 --> 00:02:17.743
I've known that guy
my whole life. Two days!

00:02:17.903 --> 00:02:20.143
Hey, did you know that
Bonnie was not his first kid?

00:02:20.303 --> 00:02:22.263
He had this other kid, Andy.

00:02:22.383 --> 00:02:23.343
And you know what?

00:02:23.463 --> 00:02:24.583
I don't think
he's ever gotten over him.

00:02:24.703 --> 00:02:26.423
(CHILDREN CHATTERING)

00:02:32.983 --> 00:02:34.663
(ROCK MUSIC PLAYING
OVER HEADPHONES)

00:02:35.343 --> 00:02:36.463
(GRUNTING)

00:02:36.543 --> 00:02:38.263
BUNNY: Psst. Hey, Lightyear.

00:02:38.663 --> 00:02:40.023
DUCKY: Hey, up here,
Astro-boy.

00:02:40.183 --> 00:02:41.743
If you think you can
just show up

00:02:41.823 --> 00:02:43.623
and take our top prize spot...

00:02:43.783 --> 00:02:44.903
-you're wrong!
-Dead wrong!

00:02:45.063 --> 00:02:46.623
You don't understand.
I'm trying to...

00:02:46.783 --> 00:02:48.663
Cheat the system and get
with a kid? Yeah, we know.

00:02:48.863 --> 00:02:50.223
No, I need...

00:02:50.383 --> 00:02:52.223
A child to shower you
with unconditional love?

00:02:52.383 --> 00:02:54.423
-Join the club, pal.
-Yeah, join the club!

00:02:54.623 --> 00:02:56.063
Come on,
help me get outta here.

00:02:56.223 --> 00:02:57.983
I'll help you. With my foot!

00:02:58.143 --> 00:02:59.503
-(GRUNTING)
-Get him.

00:02:59.663 --> 00:03:01.303
(CHUCKLES) Get him.

00:03:01.503 --> 00:03:02.583
-Bunny, what are you doing?
-Hmm?

00:03:02.663 --> 00:03:04.983
I can't reach him.
Help me out here, come on.

00:03:05.263 --> 00:03:06.943
Oh, sorry, Ducky. I'm not
a mind reader, you know.

00:03:07.103 --> 00:03:08.863
What's not to understand, hmm?

00:03:09.023 --> 00:03:10.023
You gonna make me say it?

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:11.743
-What?
-(INHALES DEEPLY)

00:03:11.863 --> 00:03:14.343
With these tiny legs, I cannot
reach without your help.

00:03:14.423 --> 00:03:15.543
Uh-huh. Okay?
This is what

00:03:15.623 --> 00:03:16.703
I've been talking about,
Bunny.

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:18.063
You need to work
on paying attention

00:03:18.143 --> 00:03:19.183
-and your listening skills.
-(SQUEAKS)

00:03:19.263 --> 00:03:20.343
Ha! (LAUGHS)

00:03:20.423 --> 00:03:22.143
How you like that, cheater?
Huh?

00:03:22.263 --> 00:03:24.623
(EXCLAIMS) Yeah! (LAUGHS)

00:03:24.743 --> 00:03:28.023
Oh, to infinity and my foot!
Boom!

00:03:28.183 --> 00:03:30.583
In a galaxy far, far away,
you got kicked in the head!

00:03:30.663 --> 00:03:31.663
Boom!

00:03:31.783 --> 00:03:33.183
How do I get out of here?

00:03:33.463 --> 00:03:34.783
VOICE BOX:
This planet is toxic.

00:03:34.943 --> 00:03:36.623
Closing helmet
to conserve oxygen.

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:38.703
In the vacuum of space,
they cannot hear you scream!

00:03:38.783 --> 00:03:40.023
(SCREAMING) Ow!

00:03:40.103 --> 00:03:41.103
Let go of me!

00:03:41.263 --> 00:03:42.463
Get off of me!

00:03:43.543 --> 00:03:44.783
Ooh! So, that's what
gravity feel like.

00:03:44.863 --> 00:03:45.863
Yeah, that's it.

00:03:45.943 --> 00:03:46.943
Hey, where you going?

00:03:48.623 --> 00:03:49.903
DUCKY: You better get
over here, spaceman!

00:03:49.983 --> 00:03:51.703
BUNNY: Yeah, put us
back up there!

00:03:51.863 --> 00:03:53.583
Bunny, what are you doing?
He's getting away, let's go!

00:03:53.743 --> 00:03:54.743
-I'm trying!
-Come on!

00:03:57.103 --> 00:03:59.143
Antique store, here we come!

00:03:59.303 --> 00:04:01.023
Bo, why do you ride around
in a skunk?

00:04:01.143 --> 00:04:03.023
-(PEOPLE SCREAMING)
-MAN: Whoa! Skunk!

00:04:03.183 --> 00:04:04.303
WOMAN: A skunk!

00:04:04.463 --> 00:04:06.103
Oh, I get it. Smart.

00:04:06.263 --> 00:04:07.743
Corndogs, corndogs, corndogs!

00:04:11.423 --> 00:04:12.943
(ALL EXCLAIMING)

00:04:14.263 --> 00:04:15.463
Why are you so bad at driving?

00:04:15.663 --> 00:04:17.423
-You got six eyes.
-(BLEATING)

00:04:17.743 --> 00:04:19.343
Thanks for the landing.

00:04:19.463 --> 00:04:22.023
-Uh... (CHUCKLES SHEEPISHLY)
-Come on, follow me.

00:04:22.543 --> 00:04:24.463
(BOTH SCREAMING)

00:04:25.983 --> 00:04:27.743
(ALL LAUGHING)

00:04:27.823 --> 00:04:28.823
-I'm fine.
-GIGGLE: His face!

00:04:28.903 --> 00:04:30.303
-That's hilarious.
-I'm fine. Don't worry.

00:04:30.383 --> 00:04:31.823
Happens all the time.

00:04:31.983 --> 00:04:32.983
Tape!

00:04:33.343 --> 00:04:34.463
Not a bad hiding spot.

00:04:34.623 --> 00:04:35.823
Yeah.
Leave the skunk.

00:04:35.983 --> 00:04:37.303
-We'll fix it later.
-GIGGLE: 10-4.

00:04:37.463 --> 00:04:39.183
This will be more fun.

00:04:39.343 --> 00:04:40.663
Let's get you to that store!

00:04:42.183 --> 00:04:44.263
Okay, spill it.
The cowboy, what's the deal?

00:04:44.423 --> 00:04:45.743
-There's no deal.
-Uh-huh.

00:04:45.903 --> 00:04:48.023
Don't do this to yourself.
Cowboy's got a kid.

00:04:48.183 --> 00:04:50.223
-Giggle...
-Trust me. I've been there.

00:04:50.383 --> 00:04:52.503
You know about me and He-Man.
I'm not proud.

00:04:52.583 --> 00:04:53.943
Shh! Here he comes!

00:04:54.063 --> 00:04:55.623
-(LAUGHS) Oh, man...
-What?

00:04:55.743 --> 00:04:57.063
No, not you.

00:04:57.223 --> 00:04:59.183
Second Chance Antiques,
straight ahead.

00:04:59.263 --> 00:05:00.503
GIGGLE: Heavy foot traffic
at the entrance.

00:05:00.623 --> 00:05:02.103
BO PEEP: Easiest way in is

00:05:02.183 --> 00:05:03.183
-the roof.
-GIGGLE: The roof!

00:05:04.143 --> 00:05:06.143
Let's go antiquing.

00:05:10.023 --> 00:05:11.023
Hold on!

00:05:11.623 --> 00:05:12.703
Huh?

00:05:13.503 --> 00:05:14.543
Whoa!

00:05:14.663 --> 00:05:15.903
How did you end up here?

00:05:16.063 --> 00:05:17.503
I thought you were given
to a new family.

00:05:17.663 --> 00:05:18.823
Oh, you know how it goes.

00:05:18.983 --> 00:05:20.143
Their little girl grew up

00:05:20.223 --> 00:05:22.863
and didn't need me anymore,
so... (BLOWS RASPBERRY)

00:05:22.943 --> 00:05:24.383
Oh, I'm sorry, Bo.

00:05:24.543 --> 00:05:26.383
Eh, who needs a kid's room...

00:05:26.543 --> 00:05:30.543
when you can have all of this?

00:05:30.863 --> 00:05:32.783
(CHILDREN GIGGLING)

00:05:43.063 --> 00:05:44.423
Whatcha looking at, Sheriff?

00:05:44.623 --> 00:05:45.863
What? Oh, uh...

00:05:46.263 --> 00:05:48.183
That wasn't...
No, uh, nothing.

00:05:49.063 --> 00:05:50.703
I was looking at the store.
Right there.

00:05:50.783 --> 00:05:52.503
I was looking
at the antique store.

00:05:52.663 --> 00:05:54.543
-Giggle, count us down.
-GIGGLE: Five.

00:05:54.623 --> 00:05:55.743
-Countdown for what?
-Four.

00:05:55.823 --> 00:05:57.023
You want to get to the store,
don't you?

00:05:57.103 --> 00:05:58.103
GIGGLE: Three. Two. One!

00:05:59.303 --> 00:06:00.423
(WOODY SCREAMING)

